- [Mitchell] Dither's a great word.

43:01.141 --> 43:05.437
It does sound like what we're doing
here. Thank you, Damon. That was fun.

43:05.520 --> 43:07.856
[Lindelof] Thank you, Elizabeth.
You rock.

43:07.939 --> 43:10.442
[Mitchell] Bad Robot.
You rock too, Damon, honestly.

43:10.525 --> 43:13.653
- [Lindelof] I'll see you real soon.
- [Mitchell sighs] Bye.

43:13.737 --> 43:15.155
